; Request kinds arrive from Users; backend kinds are what components send each other. The order is
; the Solver's index of each kind, request kinds first. Data kinds are the backend kinds that read
; or write stored data. External kinds leave the system for a third party, so no component
; receives them.
(kinds
  :request (page read write login search upload bot media rt buy job report ai feed hook push bid)
  :backend (q-read q-write auth q-search q-vector blob-put task blob-get q-tx charge q-scan infer
            notify callout k-write change)
  :data (q-read q-write q-search q-vector blob-put q-tx blob-get q-scan k-write)
  :external (callout))
